============
Introduction
============

Personal site and blog at https://windsornguyen.com.

Built with React Router framework mode, Vite, MDX, CodeHike, Supabase, and
Cloudflare Workers static assets.

==========
Running it
==========

-------------
Prerequisites
-------------

- Node 22 or newer
- pnpm 10 or newer
- Supabase CLI (only for `pnpm db` commands)
- SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY in `.dev.vars` for the Worker API

---------
Procedure
---------

 $ pnpm install
 $ pnpm dev

`pnpm dev` runs the React Router development server for content iteration.
To test the Cloudflare deployment shape locally:

 $ pnpm build
 $ pnpm preview

That serves prerendered static assets from `build/client` and routes
`/api/views/:slug` through the Worker at http://127.0.0.1:3000.

----------
Deployment
----------

Set the Supabase bindings once per Cloudflare Worker:

 $ pnpm exec wrangler secret put SUPABASE_URL
 $ pnpm exec wrangler secret put SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY

Then deploy:

 $ pnpm deploy

===========
Conventions
===========

Repo conventions (MDX shape, design tokens, env files, CSS specificity)
live in AGENTS.md.

